cff-version: 1.2.0
title: "Ya-KG: 口腔修复学（第8版）知识图谱"
message: "If you use this dataset, please cite it as below."
type: dataset
authors:
  - name: "Ya-KG contributors"
abstract: >-
  A structured knowledge graph extracted from 《口腔修复学》 (Prosthodontics),
  8th edition: 4,882 entities across 14 types, 9,242 typed relations with
  sentence-level evidence, 5,458 structured knowledge points and 1,368
  quantitative clinical parameters, each traceable to a source page.
keywords:
  - prosthodontics
  - dentistry
  - knowledge graph
  - 口腔修复学
  - 知识图谱
  - medical education
license: CC-BY-NC-SA-4.0
url: "https://psknlr.github.io/Ya-KG/"
repository-code: "https://github.com/psknlr/Ya-KG"
